<title>UK: BfG Hypo sets 235 mln mark step-up callable bond.</title>
<headline>BfG Hypo sets 235 mln mark step-up callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    235 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.125     MATURITY  **12.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    DENOMS (K) 10	  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**STEPS UP TO 5.0 PCT ON 12.JUN.97 IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON. OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 182</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
